==Finnish==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|fi|urj-fin-pro|*kasvadak}}, from {{inh|fi|urj-fpr-pro|*kaswa-}}.<ref>{{R:fi:EVE|kasvaa|accessdate=2024-01-01}}</ref> Cognates include {{cog|et|kasvama}}, {{cog|liv|kazzõ|ka'zzõ}}, {{cog|vot|kazva}}, {{cog|myv|касомс}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{fi-pronunciation|*}}

===Verb===
{{fi-verb}} {{tlb|fi|intransitive}}

# to [[grow]]
# to [[grow]] (into), [[become]] {{+obj|fi|tra<q:with adjectives or participles, only very rarely nouns>|&impersonal+ela<t:subject>+nom<qq:with nouns, or optionally with adjectives or participles>}}
